WEBVTT

00:11:29.303 --> 00:11:32.579
ZOROARK
MASTER OF ILLUSIONS

00:11:42.539 --> 00:11:46.176
As Ash's quest to become
a Pokemon Master continues,

00:11:46.395 --> 00:11:48.458
our heroes have decided
to take a shortcut

00:11:48.635 --> 00:11:52.100
to the Pokemon Backer
Championship in Crown City.

00:11:52.135 --> 00:11:53.528
However, ...

00:11:55.573 --> 00:11:58.612
Hey Brock...
You sure this is the right way?

00:12:00.253 --> 00:12:03.597
Of course I am, Ash.
-And that means we're lost, right?

00:12:03.947 --> 00:12:05.341
Not to worry, Dawn.

00:12:08.448 --> 00:12:10.403
Check out the Beautifly!

00:12:20.052 --> 00:12:22.170
There gorgeous.

00:12:26.098 --> 00:12:28.564
You know what,
if we haven't gotten lost,

00:12:28.657 --> 00:12:30.684
we would never seen them.
-Yeah!

00:12:31.332 --> 00:12:34.279
So that means, we are
lost, after all, right?

00:12:34.684 --> 00:12:36.536
You shouldn't tell a lie.

00:12:37.210 --> 00:12:38.557
Point taken.

00:12:42.438 --> 00:12:44.964
The twerps are more lost,
then they normally are.

00:12:44.965 --> 00:12:47.924
The result of which is, that
we'll get to Crown City before they do.

00:12:47.925 --> 00:12:51.091
Three legendary Pokemon
caught, before they say "boo"!

00:12:58.834 --> 00:13:00.395
It's a Skiploom.

00:13:01.369 --> 00:13:03.124
Something funny?

00:13:43.178 --> 00:13:45.336
Pikachu, what's up?

00:13:52.943 --> 00:13:54.812
Look at that.

00:14:04.392 --> 00:14:06.036
Hey, knock it off!

00:14:06.612 --> 00:14:09.039
Yeah, you!
There's nothing brave

00:14:09.081 --> 00:14:10.677
about ganging up
like that!

00:14:10.937 --> 00:14:13.606
Infernape,
I choose you!

00:14:18.497 --> 00:14:21.329
Mamoswine,
help out!

00:14:28.575 --> 00:14:30.526
Bullying is wrong!

00:14:57.483 --> 00:14:59.480
Infernape, return!

00:15:00.335 --> 00:15:02.095
Thanks, Mamoswine.

00:15:06.850 --> 00:15:09.516
I'm glad we avoided a fight.
-Yeah.

00:15:09.862 --> 00:15:11.970
I wouldn't have
needed your help, anyway.

00:15:12.145 --> 00:15:14.525
Excuse me, but you
were just about to get pushed

00:15:14.526 --> 00:15:18.716
off of a cliff, right there.
-He's right. -That's one tough Pokemon.

00:15:19.039 --> 00:15:20.143
You talked!?

00:15:20.892 --> 00:15:23.360
Yeah.
So, I did.

00:15:23.606 --> 00:15:26.809
That's telepathy.
-Mima told me, I should never

00:15:26.811 --> 00:15:29.137
talk to strangers.
Too late.

00:15:30.053 --> 00:15:32.443
I've never seen
this kinda Pokemon.

00:15:32.444 --> 00:15:35.085
Have you Brock?
-No, never.

00:15:39.375 --> 00:15:41.035
I'm going to that city,
down there.

00:15:46.699 --> 00:15:48.490
Hey, that's Crown City!

00:15:49.522 --> 00:15:51.627
So, that's it.

00:15:51.925 --> 00:15:54.234
I'm going to save Mima.

00:15:54.378 --> 00:15:57.503
But who's Mima?
-Mima's Mima.

00:15:57.777 --> 00:16:01.094
So, this Mima, you're
trying to save, is in Crown City?

00:16:02.851 --> 00:16:06.548
Mima was trying to protect me
and wound up getting caught.

00:16:09.538 --> 00:16:13.311
Some really bad people
brought us here from across the sea.

00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:16.070
You mean, they did it
against your will?

00:16:16.533 --> 00:16:19.690
Then what?
-The put us on a flying boat.

00:16:19.691 --> 00:16:23.343
You mean an airplane?
-Then, I fell of the boat.

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:25.381
So you escaped.

00:16:34.267 --> 00:16:37.131
Yeah, let's do this!
-Yeah!

00:16:39.715 --> 00:16:43.697
All right, so I'll help you out.
-Me too. -Count me in.

00:16:45.606 --> 00:16:49.066
Ok, I guess,
I can let you be my friends.

00:16:57.253 --> 00:16:58.868
No way!

00:17:00.694 --> 00:17:03.344
Well, obviously,
it can change it's appearance.

00:17:03.444 --> 00:17:04.756
Come on.

00:17:07.276 --> 00:17:09.130
Look, a tail.

00:17:15.886 --> 00:17:18.062
I like this better.

00:17:53.258 --> 00:17:55.911
Zoroark,
your mission begins.

00:17:56.245 --> 00:17:59.551
Go and show your illusions
to the people of the city.

00:18:16.985 --> 00:18:19.917
<i>Mr. Kodai.
Dispatching remote cameras.</i>

00:18:20.105 --> 00:18:22.885
Good.
Now, it's show time.

00:19:46.590 --> 00:19:49.897
See, mommy, you see?
-Tammy, morning!

00:19:49.898 --> 00:19:52.809
Oh, morning.
-So, the Coronet Fighters

00:19:52.946 --> 00:19:54.405
are gonna win, for sure!

00:19:56.088 --> 00:19:57.321
Watch this.

00:19:58.496 --> 00:20:04.202
<i>Coronet Fighters rock, roll,
because they've got the winning heart and soul!</i>

00:20:04.443 --> 00:20:07.701
Coronet Fighters in control!
-Oh, my, she's perky.

00:20:26.114 --> 00:20:28.768
Good morning, Tammy.
You know, tomorrow is...

00:20:28.904 --> 00:20:30.993
There's no time for that now!

00:20:32.613 --> 00:20:33.962
What's wrong?

00:20:34.586 --> 00:20:37.469
Wrong? Celebi has finally
come back to the city!

00:20:38.676 --> 00:20:39.698
It that true?

00:20:42.382 --> 00:20:43.856
Really.

00:20:52.220 --> 00:20:54.849
It's been years, since
all the all the cities trees and flowers

00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:56.233
were layed to waste.

00:20:56.782 --> 00:21:00.222
Yes, more then 20 years.

00:21:11.234 --> 00:21:13.506
Thau should be
illegal before noon.

00:21:14.170 --> 00:21:17.479
Some short night.
-I vote to in pitch the sun.

00:21:27.812 --> 00:21:30.999
Who's that Pokemon?
-I'm clueless.

00:21:39.991 --> 00:21:42.777
<i>Take the form of
Entei, Raikou and Suicune!</i>

00:21:43.016 --> 00:21:46.044
<i>Strike fear into
the hearts of the citizens!</i>

00:21:55.955 --> 00:21:57.922
Check that out!

00:21:58.950 --> 00:22:02.984
We've cited a Suicune.
-It practically landed in my lap.

00:22:03.138 --> 00:22:04.511
My kinda sap.

00:22:15.809 --> 00:22:17.505
Suicune?

00:22:22.638 --> 00:22:25.878
Help!
What's going on here?!

00:22:30.869 --> 00:22:32.828
Camera 1,
zoom in on Suicune.

00:22:32.829 --> 00:22:34.076
Yes, sir.

00:22:35.005 --> 00:22:37.216
And camera 2
on the fleeing people.

00:22:37.217 --> 00:22:38.731
Understood.

00:22:39.540 --> 00:22:41.629
Now, give me
a composite shot.

00:22:54.620 --> 00:22:57.846
<i>I'm sure, you don't
want me to hurt Zoroark.</i>

00:23:05.881 --> 00:23:08.244
Suicune, don't
fly the coop like that.

00:23:09.407 --> 00:23:10.662
Entei!

00:23:45.431 --> 00:23:48.603
All right,
time for my apology.

00:23:56.814 --> 00:23:59.103
Everyone,
inside!

00:24:06.005 --> 00:24:08.646
<i>Attention,
all Crown City citizens!</i>

00:24:08.647 --> 00:24:10.857
<i>The following is an
urgent communication</i>

00:24:10.857 --> 00:24:12.522
<i>from the
Kodai Network Group.</i>

00:24:12.523 --> 00:24:14.993
<i>And now,
her's president Grings Kodai.</i>

00:24:16.130 --> 00:24:20.198
<i>I'd like to take this opportunity,
to sincerely apologize to you all.</i>

00:24:21.078 --> 00:24:23.652
<i>The three legendary Pokemon,
I've brought here for you,</i>

00:24:24.083 --> 00:24:28.599
<i>Entei, Raikou and Suicune,
are now controlled by the evil Pokemon</i>

00:24:28.600 --> 00:24:31.007
<i>Zoroark.
The legendary Pokemon</i>

00:24:31.008 --> 00:24:32.735
<i>are terrorizing your city!</i>

00:24:39.317 --> 00:24:42.025
<i>Your citizens are now
in extreme danger!</i>

00:24:42.229 --> 00:24:44.941
<i>Again, my most
sincere apologize.</i>

00:25:00.521 --> 00:25:03.796
<i>We will recapture them!
That you can be sure of.</i>

00:25:04.304 --> 00:25:07.926
<i>But for now, I order
all to leave the city.</i>

00:26:01.210 --> 00:26:03.157
All right,
move along, please.

00:26:10.553 --> 00:26:13.189
This announcement is
for all people on route

00:26:13.190 --> 00:26:15.036
to the Pokemon Baker Match!

00:26:16.093 --> 00:26:19.629
The old town in Crown City
is officially of limits

00:26:19.630 --> 00:26:22.189
and access will
not be permitted!

00:26:27.922 --> 00:26:29.532
Officer Jenny.

00:26:29.695 --> 00:26:32.511
You can't deny my
access to you heart!

00:26:32.677 --> 00:26:34.580
Officer,
what's happened?

00:26:35.033 --> 00:26:37.403
It's Zoroark.
A bad Pokemon,

00:26:37.404 --> 00:26:39.822
controlling
Entei, Raikou and Suicune

00:26:39.823 --> 00:26:41.539
as they wreak havoc
in the city.

00:26:41.866 --> 00:26:44.278
Legendary Pokemon
are doing that?

00:26:44.430 --> 00:26:46.917
It's true, I saw
it with my own eyes!

00:26:46.918 --> 00:26:49.273
It's just horrible!
-But what's gonna happen

00:26:49.274 --> 00:26:51.169
with the Pokemon
Baker Match?

00:26:51.187 --> 00:26:54.736
It won't be canceled will it?
-We're working hard to solve th problem,

00:26:54.914 --> 00:26:58.087
so, please, don't worry.
-Thank goodness for that!

00:26:58.088 --> 00:27:00.702
<i>Zoroark is a Pokemon,
raging with evil.</i>

00:27:01.136 --> 00:27:04.052
<i>We're in great danger here.
Because of this,</i>

00:27:04.222 --> 00:27:06.148
<i>no one will be
allowed to enter the city,</i>

00:27:06.148 --> 00:27:08.182
<i>until recapture is complete.</i>

00:27:09.989 --> 00:27:11.378
Zoroark.

00:27:14.721 --> 00:27:17.109
Mima!
That's my Mima!

00:27:33.358 --> 00:27:35.462
Hold on!
Your Mima's the Pokemon,

00:27:35.463 --> 00:27:37.445
Zoroark, who's
terrorizing the city?

00:27:37.599 --> 00:27:40.168
Mima escaped from the bad people
and is looking for me!

00:27:40.311 --> 00:27:42.508
I'm sure of it!
-Hey! Hang on!

00:27:45.111 --> 00:27:48.006
Look, Kodai's the bad guy!
-So, the bad person,

00:27:48.007 --> 00:27:50.305
you've been talking about,
is the Kodai?

00:27:50.438 --> 00:27:52.968
That's him!
-Hey, keep it down.

00:27:52.969 --> 00:27:54.377
I wanna hear about it.

00:27:54.811 --> 00:27:56.522
All of it.

00:27:57.789 --> 00:28:00.804
I really love my twin brother,
but sometimes he'll just come out

00:28:00.927 --> 00:28:03.899
and say the craziest things.
-Twin brother, huh?

00:28:03.914 --> 00:28:06.133
And one with the tail,
no less.

00:28:09.851 --> 00:28:11.915
A Zorua!
-Zorua?

00:28:11.916 --> 00:28:13.666
An able to talk.

00:28:14.135 --> 00:28:16.938
What a surprise.
-You've seen a Zorua before?

00:28:17.819 --> 00:28:20.435
Zorua is the pre-evolved
form of Zoroark.

00:28:45.319 --> 00:28:47.278
Celebi presence
confirmed.

00:28:49.109 --> 00:28:51.261
It's just as
I saw in my vision.

00:28:51.761 --> 00:28:54.224
The Time Ripple
must be in Crown City.

00:28:59.656 --> 00:29:01.537
Mr. Kodai!

00:29:09.543 --> 00:29:11.032
<i>The Time Ripple!</i>

00:29:11.350 --> 00:29:13.033
<i>And the countdown clock!</i>

00:29:13.288 --> 00:29:16.659
<i>My vision...
My vision has become clouded!</i>

00:29:16.957 --> 00:29:19.267
<i>I must be reaching
my limit!</i>

00:29:22.472 --> 00:29:24.389
<i>Who are these people?</i>

00:29:25.951 --> 00:29:27.876
<i>What?
That's...</i>

00:29:31.818 --> 00:29:35.083
<i>I knew it!
The Time Ripple will be mine!</i>

00:29:38.959 --> 00:29:41.183
It's a vision
of the future?

00:29:41.596 --> 00:29:44.098
That's right, Rowena.
-What are you seeing?

00:29:44.462 --> 00:29:46.597
Faces of people,
trying to...

00:29:46.900 --> 00:29:48.762
...stop me.

00:29:52.174 --> 00:29:55.004
So, Kodai was involved
in the whole thing.

00:29:55.145 --> 00:29:58.803
Only thing we wanna do,
is bring Zorua back to Zoroark and fast.

00:29:59.582 --> 00:30:01.842
I'm gonna go
find my Mima.

00:30:02.370 --> 00:30:06.388
Right, I'll help anyway I can.
-Awesome, thanks!

00:30:07.061 --> 00:30:10.024
Hey, I'm Ash
and this is my partner, Pikachu.

00:30:11.136 --> 00:30:13.822
My name is Dawn
and this is Piplop.

00:30:14.594 --> 00:30:15.621
I'm Brock.

00:30:15.859 --> 00:30:18.802
The name's Karl.
I'm a journalist.

00:30:20.069 --> 00:30:23.069
I had a hunch, Kodai has been
keeping some kinda secret

00:30:23.070 --> 00:30:24.847
and I've been
investigating it.

00:30:35.935 --> 00:30:38.750
What's that? -It connects
to the old part of the city.

00:30:39.870 --> 00:30:42.962
The truth is,
Crown City is my home town.

00:30:48.453 --> 00:30:50.765
Bronzor,
use Flash!

00:30:57.792 --> 00:31:02.092
Grings Kodai has been called
"The man who can see into the future".

00:31:02.264 --> 00:31:03.357
Future?

00:31:04.290 --> 00:31:08.157
And it sure seems that way.
Kodai has had an incredible

00:31:08.158 --> 00:31:11.991
series of business successes.
Like he knows what's going to happen.

00:31:12.617 --> 00:31:16.090
He now has control
over the main stream media.

00:31:20.939 --> 00:31:24.347
The word on the street is,
in order to get, what he wants,

00:31:24.454 --> 00:31:27.642
there's absolutely nothing
he won't do.

00:31:28.806 --> 00:31:30.789
But, what's Kodai
doing this time?

00:31:30.830 --> 00:31:32.436
By controlling Zoroark?

00:31:32.616 --> 00:31:35.847
Beats me.
-But he's a bad man!

00:31:38.570 --> 00:31:39.852
Let's hurry!

00:31:39.853 --> 00:31:42.893
Hey, don't you dare
change into me!

00:31:47.687 --> 00:31:48.977
Good.

00:32:06.002 --> 00:32:08.819
It appears, that the old town
is completely deserted.

00:32:08.948 --> 00:32:11.084
<i>Good,
I'm heading there now.</i>

00:32:11.257 --> 00:32:12.240
<i>Sir!</i>

00:32:12.596 --> 00:32:15.013
Zoroark's mission is complete.
Recapture it.

00:32:15.159 --> 00:32:16.230
<i>Understood.</i>

00:32:53.216 --> 00:32:55.713
Zoroak's recapture,
complete.

00:32:59.921 --> 00:33:02.340
Now, transferring
to air ship.

00:33:23.347 --> 00:33:26.256
No fair,
getting Zoroark was our game!

00:33:26.385 --> 00:33:28.343
Who were,
those greedy rascals?

00:33:28.486 --> 00:33:31.254
Strange ones.
-But the legendary Pokemon

00:33:31.255 --> 00:33:32.947
trio's still prime
for pluckin'.

00:33:33.184 --> 00:33:36.816
That's three for me,
so shall we make history?

00:33:44.004 --> 00:33:47.382
Rowena, continue
transferring the footage.

00:33:47.532 --> 00:33:48.631
As you wish.

00:34:04.196 --> 00:34:05.984
I was afraid he'd
never leave.

00:34:06.170 --> 00:34:09.799
Ok, maybe now, I can
get some real work done.

00:34:24.658 --> 00:34:27.288
Yes, it won't be long now.

00:34:35.720 --> 00:34:37.766
Thank you, Bronzor.

00:34:38.694 --> 00:34:41.596
Wow, what a pretty place.
-Sure is.

00:34:42.818 --> 00:34:44.810
Hey, Karl,
isn't that Celebi?

00:34:45.039 --> 00:34:45.764
Right.

00:34:46.305 --> 00:34:49.015
They say, that Celebi sometimes
comes here to visit.

00:34:49.050 --> 00:34:51.782
Take a look.
It's like the city in forest

00:34:51.783 --> 00:34:53.641
coexist in perfect harmony.

00:34:54.042 --> 00:34:56.200
Yeah, but it wasn't
always this way.

00:34:58.229 --> 00:35:01.887
Twenty years ago, almost all of
the trees and flower here

00:35:02.023 --> 00:35:03.855
died off.
-How did that happen?

00:35:04.183 --> 00:35:06.432
No, one knows.
Anyway...

00:35:06.606 --> 00:35:08.545
It was a terrible time.

00:35:22.236 --> 00:35:24.975
But working together,
people and Pokemon,

00:35:24.976 --> 00:35:28.367
finally brought Crown City
back to it's beautiful life.

00:35:33.365 --> 00:35:36.207
You could never tell,
that things were once so bad.

00:35:39.132 --> 00:35:41.728
I can smell Mima.
-Really?

00:35:42.983 --> 00:35:44.343
Are you sure?

00:35:51.621 --> 00:35:53.382
Mima was here,
for sure.

00:35:53.621 --> 00:35:56.548
I told you before,
not me!

00:35:58.891 --> 00:36:00.187
Thank you.

00:36:02.095 --> 00:36:05.314
Mima!
I'm over here!

00:36:05.501 --> 00:36:07.368
Mima!

00:36:12.434 --> 00:36:15.083
Hey, don't worry.
Mima's looking for you too,

00:36:15.084 --> 00:36:18.264
I'm sure. It's not gonna
be very much longer.

00:36:18.713 --> 00:36:21.769
Right.
Yeah, I can feel it.

00:36:30.062 --> 00:36:31.208
That's weird.

00:36:32.218 --> 00:36:33.995
It's not destroyed.

00:36:39.761 --> 00:36:43.311
You're right.
But, I saw Entei on the news.

00:36:43.482 --> 00:36:44.890
What does it mean?

00:36:46.982 --> 00:36:48.551
Kodai did this.

00:36:48.745 --> 00:36:51.330
He manipulated
the TV news images.

00:36:51.331 --> 00:36:52.980
Fake video?

00:36:53.563 --> 00:36:55.736
Zoroark has the power
to take the shape of the

00:36:55.737 --> 00:36:58.052
legendary Pokemon.
-So, you mean,

00:36:58.053 --> 00:37:00.228
legendary Pokemon
aren't really here?

00:37:00.229 --> 00:37:02.216
Then Kodai
tricked us.

00:37:03.835 --> 00:37:05.768
Mima's scent is this way.

00:37:06.072 --> 00:37:07.479
Ok, let's go!

00:37:11.370 --> 00:37:15.278
<i>Zoroark is an evil Pokemon.
Until it is captured,</i>

00:37:15.481 --> 00:37:18.034
<i>no one will be allowed
to enter the city.</i>

00:37:18.229 --> 00:37:20.406
<i>Thanks you
for your cooperation.</i>

00:37:22.309 --> 00:37:25.818
<i>My vision of the future
has been proven correct.</i>

00:37:27.558 --> 00:37:30.131
<i>This is Rowena, sir.
Beginning today,</i>

00:37:30.132 --> 00:37:31.863
<i>she'll be your
executive secretary.</i>

00:37:32.339 --> 00:37:34.320
<i>It's an honor, sir.</i>

00:37:34.556 --> 00:37:36.429
<i>Very good!</i>

00:37:39.986 --> 00:37:41.135
<i>Mr. Kodai!</i>

00:37:41.276 --> 00:37:42.707
<i>Don't worry.</i>

00:37:51.257 --> 00:37:55.741
<i>What is this?
I need more clarity.</i>

00:37:57.305 --> 00:37:59.047
<i>The Time Ripple!</i>

00:38:16.790 --> 00:38:18.772
<i>No, don't stop!</i>

00:38:19.419 --> 00:38:22.871
<i>I still can't see the precise
location of the Time Ripple!</i>

00:38:30.824 --> 00:38:34.604
<i>It's been quite a long time,
since Kodai last had a future vision.</i>

00:38:34.753 --> 00:38:37.022
<i>A future vision?</i>

00:38:38.441 --> 00:38:40.255
<i>I'm losing my power!</i>

00:38:45.774 --> 00:38:47.653
<i>The Time Ripple appears.</i>

00:38:48.022 --> 00:38:51.950
<i>It's the day before the
Pokemon Baker Championship begins.</i>

00:38:52.441 --> 00:38:56.201
<i>Zoroark and the legendary
Pokemon are running wild.</i>

00:38:57.090 --> 00:38:59.255
<i>And I'm there too.</i>

00:39:01.053 --> 00:39:02.338
<i>I must find it.</i>

00:39:02.545 --> 00:39:05.087
<i>Before the
Time Ripple disappears.</i>

00:39:12.800 --> 00:39:16.626
The countdown clocks.
There all around the city.

00:39:17.020 --> 00:39:19.718
And the Time Ripple
must be near one of them.

00:39:30.053 --> 00:39:32.629
Shuppet,
use Foresight!

00:39:57.248 --> 00:39:58.957
Not here.

00:40:02.108 --> 00:40:04.239
Twenty more spots.

00:40:15.368 --> 00:40:17.899
So they showed up after all!

00:40:21.997 --> 00:40:23.300
<i>Goone, do you copy?</i>

00:40:23.301 --> 00:40:23.972
Sir!

00:40:24.255 --> 00:40:26.884
<i>There's a little problem,
I want you to take care of.</i>

00:40:26.884 --> 00:40:28.169
Sir!

00:40:31.346 --> 00:40:33.216
Mima's scent is here too.

00:40:34.327 --> 00:40:36.770
Hey, Karl,
what's that a statue of?

00:40:37.028 --> 00:40:38.798
The city's guardian
protectors.

00:40:39.060 --> 00:40:40.491
Guardian protectors?

00:40:40.682 --> 00:40:43.555
When Crown City
was in danger in ancient times,

00:40:43.749 --> 00:40:46.605
it is said, that
Entei, Raikou and Suicune,

00:40:46.755 --> 00:40:48.862
came here to rescue it
and its people.

00:40:49.037 --> 00:40:50.759
There statues
are all over the city.

00:40:50.983 --> 00:40:53.515
And to think
Celebi comes here, as well.

00:40:54.197 --> 00:40:56.332
Sad to know, it's being hurt.

00:41:03.838 --> 00:41:05.877
That's still
in one piece too.

00:41:07.238 --> 00:41:08.623
Mima's this way!

00:41:09.062 --> 00:41:10.451
Zorua!

00:41:40.859 --> 00:41:43.746
<i>...controlled by the
dark Pokemon, Zoroark,</i>

00:41:44.752 --> 00:41:46.549
<i>and are now running amok.</i>

00:41:46.922 --> 00:41:48.707
It's all lies!

00:41:49.423 --> 00:41:51.573
<i>No one will be allowed
to enter the city,</i>

00:41:51.714 --> 00:41:53.689
<i>until we capture it...</i>

00:42:04.995 --> 00:42:07.475
Who do you think you are?
I'm strong, you know?

00:42:13.672 --> 00:42:17.254
I'm... strong...
stay...

00:42:27.693 --> 00:42:29.078
You ok?

00:42:29.559 --> 00:42:31.087
Come on!
Cut it out!

00:42:32.428 --> 00:42:33.912
Yeah, all right!

00:42:34.735 --> 00:42:36.710
Been a long time,
Mightyena.

00:42:37.229 --> 00:42:39.408
Ok, ok...
-Oh, my, Karl!

00:42:39.572 --> 00:42:40.895
It really is you.

00:42:41.718 --> 00:42:43.884
Hey there, grandpa.
Great to see you.

00:42:46.710 --> 00:42:49.384
My dear Karl,
such a long time.

00:42:49.640 --> 00:42:50.471
Tammy!

00:42:55.110 --> 00:42:57.649
Zorua!
-This little one is your friend?

00:42:57.825 --> 00:43:00.048
Tangrowth's sleep powder
worked a little to well.

00:43:00.215 --> 00:43:01.870
I'm sorry.

00:43:04.027 --> 00:43:06.259
Got to find Mima.

00:43:07.588 --> 00:43:11.093
<i>Entei, Raikou and Suicune
are now controlled</i>

00:43:11.231 --> 00:43:15.613
<i>by the evil Pokemon Zoroark.
Those three are terrorizing your city.</i>

00:43:15.798 --> 00:43:17.274
<i>Citiz...</i>

00:43:17.682 --> 00:43:20.029
Zoroark must have changed
into the shape of those

00:43:20.197 --> 00:43:23.065
legendary Pokemon.
The city hasn't been destroyed.

00:43:24.133 --> 00:43:26.508
So, this whole event
was nothing but a trick?

00:43:26.682 --> 00:43:30.214
I knew all along, that our guardian
protectors wouldn't do any of this.

00:43:30.362 --> 00:43:33.692
Yeah, Kodai's the only bad guy.
-And of course, that means,

00:43:33.827 --> 00:43:36.944
Zoroark is innocent too.
-You're right.

00:43:37.360 --> 00:43:39.384
But, why didn't the two
of you evacuate?

00:43:41.617 --> 00:43:44.217
The truth is, neither one of us,
could bear the thought of leaving

00:43:44.404 --> 00:43:46.092
our beautiful home.
-And after all,

00:43:46.210 --> 00:43:48.768
Celebi finally just returned,
after so long.

00:43:49.669 --> 00:43:51.927
Celebi's here?
-Are you sure?

00:43:53.509 --> 00:43:56.536
Tangrowth and I, both saw
it with our very own eyes.

00:43:56.745 --> 00:43:59.653
Right, see it's been twenty
long years, since the day,

00:43:59.822 --> 00:44:03.813
when all our lush greenery died
and that's when Celebi stopped

00:44:04.002 --> 00:44:05.434
coming back to visit.

00:44:09.870 --> 00:44:11.227
Mima.

00:44:36.826 --> 00:44:39.268
Mima!
Mima's calling me!

00:44:39.454 --> 00:44:40.292
Zorua.

00:44:42.440 --> 00:44:44.227
Zorua, calm down!

00:44:45.011 --> 00:44:48.036
Mima!
Where's my Mima?

00:44:58.386 --> 00:45:01.438
Pikachu!
-Piplop!

00:45:05.407 --> 00:45:06.717
Follow me!

00:45:22.117 --> 00:45:23.819
What do you want?

00:45:26.283 --> 00:45:28.330
I've got no
reason to fight you.

00:46:10.926 --> 00:46:14.005
Out of my way!
I'm gonna go find my Mima!

00:47:08.577 --> 00:47:11.141
Look at that!
-The berries.

00:47:22.347 --> 00:47:23.837
That's for me?

00:47:35.767 --> 00:47:37.719
I surprised you.

00:47:39.132 --> 00:47:41.450
No, I can't fly.

00:47:43.076 --> 00:47:46.161
I think, I'll let you
be my friend too.

00:47:48.468 --> 00:47:51.195
Come on, you can
help me look for Mima.

00:47:52.009 --> 00:47:53.502
Let's go!

00:48:07.469 --> 00:48:09.946
You see that?
That Pokemon with Zorua?

00:48:10.255 --> 00:48:11.305
It looked like Celebi.

00:48:11.477 --> 00:48:14.914
Of course! So, Celebi
made the berries grow.

00:48:27.541 --> 00:48:28.825
What do you think...

00:48:29.950 --> 00:48:32.033
Ash, no.
-Are you ok?

00:48:32.117 --> 00:48:34.605
Not one of you,
has the power to resist me.

00:48:34.941 --> 00:48:37.155
It's you.
-Kodai.

00:48:37.399 --> 00:48:39.043
So, why did you
lock us up?

00:48:39.202 --> 00:48:41.915
I don't know, who you are,
and I couldn't care less.

00:48:42.118 --> 00:48:44.988
But, I'm certain, I won't allow you
to get in my way

00:48:45.177 --> 00:48:47.512
and that you can depend on.
-What do you mean?

00:48:48.008 --> 00:48:50.174
I have the power
to see the future.

00:48:50.224 --> 00:48:51.439
Future?

00:48:51.830 --> 00:48:55.985
And all obstacles in my path.
And so, I must remove all of them.

00:49:01.512 --> 00:49:04.075
No use.
-But, Karl...

00:49:05.725 --> 00:49:09.390
Check out the wide load.
-A legendary load, per chance.

00:49:09.584 --> 00:49:12.314
I'll wager it's Entei,
Raikou or Suicune.

00:49:12.506 --> 00:49:15.261
Well, this time we have
the element of surprise.

00:49:15.460 --> 00:49:16.858
Words to the wise!

00:49:21.796 --> 00:49:22.978
No!

00:49:55.205 --> 00:49:57.841
Mima, where are you?

00:50:35.216 --> 00:50:37.219
Mima.

00:50:50.842 --> 00:50:54.940
Mima,
I miss you so much.

00:51:11.631 --> 00:51:13.780
You're amazing.

00:51:17.046 --> 00:51:20.410
It's kinda of like
being curled up in Mima's fur.

00:52:00.734 --> 00:52:03.609
So, his most important files
are locked.

00:52:04.442 --> 00:52:07.227
Now, what password,
would he come up with?

00:52:09.114 --> 00:52:12.387
V-I-S-I-O-N.

00:52:14.947 --> 00:52:17.968
On one try, that was
almost to easy.

00:52:21.010 --> 00:52:23.776
Books of ancient prophecies.

00:52:27.565 --> 00:52:29.440
So that's it.

00:52:29.721 --> 00:52:31.366
That explains everything.

00:52:31.894 --> 00:52:32.599
<i>Rowena!</i>

00:52:33.039 --> 00:52:36.833
<i>I'm heading back to Kodai's location,
I'll be a bit longer.</i>

00:52:37.032 --> 00:52:39.534
Stay put, until
our mission is complete.

00:52:39.673 --> 00:52:41.212
<i>Understood, sir.</i>

00:52:45.238 --> 00:52:47.850
My heart!
That scared me.

00:52:53.734 --> 00:52:55.317
What's that?

00:53:05.182 --> 00:53:07.608
Who are you?
-My name's Rowena.

00:53:07.991 --> 00:53:10.054
Mr. Kodai's
executive secretary.

00:53:10.282 --> 00:53:12.152
Right, and I'm his mom.

00:53:12.771 --> 00:53:15.358
I'm actually a news
paper reporter, just like Karl.

00:53:15.616 --> 00:53:17.440
I'm working undercover,
right now.

00:53:20.668 --> 00:53:22.652
Investigating Kodai.

00:53:23.550 --> 00:53:26.036
Your on our side!
-Excellent!

00:53:26.381 --> 00:53:27.993
I had a feeling
you'd show up.

00:53:28.177 --> 00:53:29.882
My investigation's complete.

00:53:30.224 --> 00:53:31.878
It's all here.

00:53:42.682 --> 00:53:45.383
So, this is it.
-You see, Kodai is trying

00:53:45.571 --> 00:53:46.806
to locate the Time Ripple.

00:53:47.300 --> 00:53:49.033
Time...
-...Ripple?

00:53:49.182 --> 00:53:50.573
Grandpa told me about it.

00:53:51.469 --> 00:53:54.489
It appears, when Celebi comes
to visit is, from the future.

00:53:54.749 --> 00:53:57.114
Right.
The Time Ripple is a temporary

00:53:57.306 --> 00:53:59.918
focal point that
actually collects time energy.

00:54:01.437 --> 00:54:03.452
The Time Ripple last
for only about a day

00:54:03.652 --> 00:54:05.277
and in provides all the
necessary energy

00:54:05.457 --> 00:54:07.262
for Celebi to
be able to time travel.

00:54:09.205 --> 00:54:13.045
Kodai wants that energy
for himself, before it disappears.

00:54:13.271 --> 00:54:16.245
Which he'll accomplish by
absorbing it into his body.

00:54:16.449 --> 00:54:19.203
Why would he wanna do that?
-So, he'll have the power

00:54:19.376 --> 00:54:21.973
to see into the future.
-The future?

00:54:22.328 --> 00:54:25.176
Of course, remember,
he said, he could do that.

00:54:26.215 --> 00:54:28.843
It was twenty years ago,
when Kodai gain the power

00:54:29.023 --> 00:54:32.904
to see into the future.
By deciphering the ancient texts,

00:54:33.068 --> 00:54:35.938
Kodai was able to unlock
the secrets of the prophets

00:54:36.145 --> 00:54:38.365
and he learned, that the
Time Ripple actually

00:54:38.543 --> 00:54:41.752
contains the power
to show people the future.

00:54:42.275 --> 00:54:45.341
And so Kodai came here.
To the city, where Celebi

00:54:45.527 --> 00:54:47.015
is known to appear.

00:54:53.134 --> 00:54:55.285
Shuppet,
Foresight.

00:55:12.005 --> 00:55:14.783
Finally, there it is!
The Time Ripple!

00:55:17.153 --> 00:55:19.550
Don't let Celebi
touch the Time Ripple.

00:55:28.008 --> 00:55:30.804
I've learned, the Time Ripple
disappears, when you touch it.

00:55:38.477 --> 00:55:41.092
But, now it belongs to me.

00:57:17.536 --> 00:57:21.485
I did it.
The future truly is all mine!

00:57:21.642 --> 00:57:25.313
So, the flow of energy was reversed
and the trees and the flowers

00:57:25.509 --> 00:57:29.339
in the city withered and died
and Kodai gained the power

00:57:29.387 --> 00:57:31.352
to see into the future.

00:57:35.233 --> 00:57:39.114
Since that time,
Kodai's plan has become reality.

00:57:39.491 --> 00:57:41.769
So then, Kodai was the one
responsible for killing

00:57:41.958 --> 00:57:43.186
all the cities greenery.

00:57:51.636 --> 00:57:53.379
Not here!
-Is this the last

00:57:53.501 --> 00:57:55.349
of the countdown clocks,
Mr. Kodai?

00:57:55.558 --> 00:57:58.070
Yes.
We've checked all the others.

00:57:58.418 --> 00:58:01.856
Where is it?
My visions never failed me before.

00:58:14.605 --> 00:58:16.143
Mr. Kodai!

00:58:20.469 --> 00:58:21.957
It's Celebi.

00:58:24.246 --> 00:58:26.725
But now, Kodai's
power to see the future

00:58:26.913 --> 00:58:28.112
is fading.

00:58:29.776 --> 00:58:31.435
And that's why,
he so desperate

00:58:31.599 --> 00:58:33.853
to absorb the energy of
the Time Ripple again.

00:58:33.962 --> 00:58:36.358
I get it now.
-Now, according to one

00:58:36.496 --> 00:58:38.267
of Kodai's visions,
the Time Ripple is near

00:58:38.407 --> 00:58:39.726
a countdown clock.

00:58:41.598 --> 00:58:43.882
So, needless to say,
he's frantic to find it.

00:58:44.985 --> 00:58:47.483
But, if Kodai finds
the Time Ripple again,...

00:58:47.662 --> 00:58:50.782
Then the city will wither
and die, like before.

00:58:51.479 --> 00:58:52.684
You've got it.

00:58:53.708 --> 00:58:55.601
We won't let that happen!

00:58:59.906 --> 00:59:01.617
Kodai's on the move again.

00:59:39.138 --> 00:59:42.174
Zorua! So, this is where
you've been hiding.

00:59:42.409 --> 00:59:44.856
Be careful.
He's a very bad man.

00:59:46.232 --> 00:59:48.481
So, you can talk!
-Yeah.

00:59:48.648 --> 00:59:50.739
But, I never wanted
to talk to you.

00:59:50.806 --> 00:59:52.281
Then, stay out of the way.

00:59:52.937 --> 00:59:55.867
My business is with Celebi.
-What do you want?

00:59:56.096 --> 00:59:58.719
Now, Shuppet,
Psychic, let's go!

01:00:00.568 --> 01:00:01.832
Celebi!

01:00:05.541 --> 01:00:07.046
Stay out of this!

01:00:13.617 --> 01:00:15.472
I won't let you
hurt Celebi!

01:00:15.647 --> 01:00:17.162
Impudent app start.

01:00:25.960 --> 01:00:28.385
Your powers of
deceptions have grown.

01:00:28.938 --> 01:00:31.191
But, they have no
effect on me.

01:00:35.667 --> 01:00:37.801
All right, Shuppet,
Shadow Ball!

01:00:54.358 --> 01:00:55.954
Mima...

01:01:26.343 --> 01:01:27.601
Was that...

01:02:18.263 --> 01:02:20.348
All four on mess.
-Yeah.

01:02:20.539 --> 01:02:23.239
Except, there not lookin'
quite the same as before.

01:02:23.411 --> 01:02:26.049
Stop living in the past.
We've got us a one stop swipe.

01:02:26.197 --> 01:02:28.310
Isn't that neat?
-Sweet!

01:02:55.023 --> 01:02:56.818
Perfect!
My vision's unfolding

01:02:56.957 --> 01:02:58.210
just as I thought!

01:03:02.331 --> 01:03:04.077
Yes, the Time Ripple.

01:03:06.708 --> 01:03:09.928
More!
Show me more, now!

01:03:25.685 --> 01:03:27.056
Celebi!

01:03:27.679 --> 01:03:28.932
Cut it out!

01:03:58.472 --> 01:04:00.967
Suicune!
-Somethin' strange is up.

01:04:34.903 --> 01:04:37.628
Those are the real
three legendary Pokemon.

01:04:37.789 --> 01:04:40.069
Guardian protectors.
-That's right.

01:04:48.733 --> 01:04:51.297
But, they must think,
that Zoroark is the enemy.

01:04:51.510 --> 01:04:53.587
Right.
We're in danger!

01:05:08.091 --> 01:05:09.699
Mr. Kodai.

01:05:15.185 --> 01:05:17.385
I still want to see more.

01:05:21.526 --> 01:05:22.978
Get them!

01:05:51.988 --> 01:05:53.201
Rowena!

01:05:53.661 --> 01:05:54.782
I knew it.

01:05:55.086 --> 01:05:57.933
Sorry, I lied to you, Kodai.
The last paycheck...

01:05:58.165 --> 01:05:59.355
Forget about it.

01:05:59.507 --> 01:06:02.011
Pikachu!
-Piplop!

01:06:05.974 --> 01:06:07.051
Celebi!

01:06:07.246 --> 01:06:08.728
Zorua!

01:06:28.701 --> 01:06:29.788
Those punks.

01:06:30.233 --> 01:06:32.347
Mr. Kodai,
what do we do now?

01:06:32.512 --> 01:06:34.768
I foresaw,
that Rowena would betray me.

01:06:35.486 --> 01:06:38.069
And I know, precisely,
what will happen.

01:07:42.649 --> 01:07:46.305
What's this?
-It's grandpa's workshop.

01:07:48.853 --> 01:07:49.878
Your back!

01:07:50.538 --> 01:07:52.641
And you're all right.
-Hey, Joe.

01:07:52.815 --> 01:07:53.834
Hi, Tammy.

01:07:55.417 --> 01:07:56.621
Celebi!

01:07:59.616 --> 01:08:04.070
So, Kodai was behind
Crown City's disaster

01:08:04.216 --> 01:08:05.990
from twenty years ago too.

01:08:09.529 --> 01:08:11.109
You'll be just fine.

01:08:12.421 --> 01:08:15.094
I couldn't protect Celebi.

01:08:16.984 --> 01:08:18.874
Not long,
before you came back,

01:08:19.047 --> 01:08:23.720
we actually got a glimpse
of the real Entei, Raikou and Suicune.

01:08:23.945 --> 01:08:26.694
They must have sensed,
that the city is in grave danger.

01:08:27.109 --> 01:08:30.362
Yes, but there all convinced,
that the enemy is Zoroark.

01:08:30.696 --> 01:08:34.044
So, how can we get them
to understand, that there wrong?

01:08:35.487 --> 01:08:37.068
Mima!

01:08:38.179 --> 01:08:39.278
Celebi!

01:08:40.712 --> 01:08:42.455
Take it easy, Celebi.

01:08:42.715 --> 01:08:44.934
If we can somehow
reach the Time Ripple,

01:08:45.100 --> 01:08:47.448
then Celebi
should be just fine.

01:08:47.707 --> 01:08:49.462
Yeah, but where
is the Time Ripple?

01:08:49.767 --> 01:08:53.081
Kodai was searching around
the vicinity of the countdown clocks.

01:08:53.616 --> 01:08:55.941
But he had already
checked them all.

01:08:56.414 --> 01:08:59.413
So, you mean, Kodai's
already gotten his hands

01:08:59.558 --> 01:09:00.830
on the Time Ripple?

01:09:01.024 --> 01:09:04.065
No, not yet.
The city's still lush and green.

01:09:04.538 --> 01:09:08.017
The thing is,
there's one other countdown clock.

01:09:08.737 --> 01:09:09.458
Up there.

01:09:09.709 --> 01:09:11.990
See, I'm the one,
who designed them all.

01:09:19.995 --> 01:09:21.566
It's in the Stadium.

01:09:22.342 --> 01:09:26.003
Located among the trees,
that were moved there from the city.

01:09:26.266 --> 01:09:30.464
<i>I placed the prototype there,
to commemorate the Stadiums completion.</i>

01:09:30.655 --> 01:09:32.288
<i>So, the Time Ripple
must be there too.</i>

01:09:32.444 --> 01:09:34.588
And I'll be the one
to reach it first!

01:09:43.559 --> 01:09:46.129
What's that?
-One of Kodai's robots.

01:09:46.405 --> 01:09:49.055
But, what we just said...
-He heard all of it.

01:09:49.271 --> 01:09:51.969
We've got to get
to the Time Ripple.

01:09:52.126 --> 01:09:54.768
Or what happened twenty years ago,
will happen again.

01:09:55.048 --> 01:09:57.145
It just can't!
-Tammy's right!

01:09:57.312 --> 01:10:00.235
So, we've got to get Celebi
to the Time Ripple first.

01:10:02.546 --> 01:10:05.196
Don't worry, Celebi.
I'll take you there myself.

01:10:05.365 --> 01:10:07.291
I'm going.
-Me too.

01:10:10.156 --> 01:10:12.675
There's now way,
I'd ever give up.

01:10:12.812 --> 01:10:14.885
So, you can count
me in too.

01:10:15.848 --> 01:10:17.514
All right, let's go.

01:10:18.884 --> 01:10:19.798
Wait a minute.

01:10:20.971 --> 01:10:22.739
Kodai can see the future, right?

01:10:25.521 --> 01:10:29.444
That's why, we'll work together
to change the future.

01:10:34.492 --> 01:10:36.930
Taking this shortcut,
should take us all to the Stadium

01:10:37.092 --> 01:10:40.121
before Kodai!
-You sure, your right this time, Brock?

01:10:40.277 --> 01:10:43.796
Trust me, no need to worry!
-I always trust you, Brock!

01:11:20.919 --> 01:11:22.182
What's this?

01:11:28.063 --> 01:11:30.439
There trapped
in Zoroark's illusion.

01:11:30.745 --> 01:11:35.405
Stop all this, at once, Zoroark!
-They made a mistake, that's all!

01:12:32.971 --> 01:12:35.565
The Stadium!
-It's right over there.

01:12:42.593 --> 01:12:43.526
It's them!

01:12:43.704 --> 01:12:45.589
Ash and Pikachu,
go on ahead!

01:12:58.871 --> 01:13:00.575
Good luck, you two!

01:13:01.622 --> 01:13:03.861
You go and deal with them, now!

01:13:03.901 --> 01:13:04.949
Right.

01:13:42.013 --> 01:13:43.955
Pikachu, use Thunderbolt!

01:13:45.121 --> 01:13:47.192
Mismagius,
Psywave, quick!

01:13:50.910 --> 01:13:53.762
Celebi, hurry
and fly to the Time Ripple!

01:13:57.095 --> 01:13:58.707
Stop Celebi!

01:14:03.387 --> 01:14:06.198
Don't let Celebi
touch the Time Ripple!

01:14:11.873 --> 01:14:14.197
Now, Piplop!
Whirlpool!

01:14:27.046 --> 01:14:29.621
Mamoswine!
-Hang tough, everyone!

01:14:29.783 --> 01:14:32.155
It's about time
to finish you punks off!

01:14:37.497 --> 01:14:39.566
It's Zoroark!
But how?

01:14:51.432 --> 01:14:53.175
Everyone, get back!

01:15:13.988 --> 01:15:15.768
Zorua, it's you!

01:15:27.035 --> 01:15:29.998
Use Psywave
and Shadow Ball!

01:15:35.810 --> 01:15:38.060
You are a bad man!

01:15:43.557 --> 01:15:45.062
That's enough!

01:15:59.110 --> 01:16:01.609
Celebi.
Sorry, but Zorua

01:16:01.806 --> 01:16:03.531
managed to lead them away.

01:16:04.004 --> 01:16:07.079
Come on, just a little
further to the Time Ripple.

01:16:07.545 --> 01:16:09.356
Guess, you still can't fly.

01:16:35.493 --> 01:16:36.916
That's it!

01:16:41.568 --> 01:16:43.607
Mismagius, Psychic!

01:16:52.659 --> 01:16:53.902
Of course.

01:16:54.430 --> 01:16:55.818
Celebi is hurt,

01:16:56.008 --> 01:16:58.711
that's why it has revealed itself.

01:17:09.119 --> 01:17:11.234
Stop right there, Zoroark!

01:17:12.412 --> 01:17:13.670
Zorua!

01:17:14.587 --> 01:17:17.849
One step closer
and this little one is no more.

01:17:25.544 --> 01:17:28.602
I guess, there isn't
much time left for me.

01:17:30.477 --> 01:17:32.723
Shuppet, clean this up.

01:17:41.917 --> 01:17:43.437
Zoroark!

01:17:44.352 --> 01:17:47.864
I've thoroughly enjoyed
playing our little game of tag.

01:17:51.165 --> 01:17:54.709
However, I already knew
it would end this way!

01:18:05.544 --> 01:18:08.321
Stop, Kodai!
All the trees and flowers will die!

01:18:09.029 --> 01:18:13.050
What do I care!
So long, as my visionary powers grow,

01:18:13.272 --> 01:18:14.684
it's all worth it!

01:18:15.997 --> 01:18:18.754
So, you don't care
what happens to Crown City?

01:18:29.986 --> 01:18:33.937
It's true, that twenty years ago,
when I touched the Time Ripple,

01:18:34.136 --> 01:18:36.228
Crown City withered.

01:18:36.427 --> 01:18:39.244
But, no one knows
a thing about that.

01:18:39.490 --> 01:18:42.327
Just as no one will
know what I've done today.

01:18:44.035 --> 01:18:46.771
All anyone knows is, that I'm
doing my level best

01:18:46.926 --> 01:18:49.323
to capture the evil
Pokemon, Zoroark.

01:18:59.983 --> 01:19:01.855
Victory is mine!

01:19:33.974 --> 01:19:38.121
This can't be an illusion?
But, my illusion canceler!

01:19:42.681 --> 01:19:44.205
When it bite me!

01:19:49.220 --> 01:19:51.294
Your finished, Kodai!
Give it up!

01:19:51.391 --> 01:19:52.730
It's Karl!

01:19:53.120 --> 01:19:54.270
Not you!

01:20:14.549 --> 01:20:15.959
Mima.

01:20:16.326 --> 01:20:17.728
I missed you.

01:20:17.921 --> 01:20:20.675
Shuppet, quick.
Use Shadow Ball!

01:20:27.475 --> 01:20:28.816
Zoroark!

01:20:40.191 --> 01:20:41.345
Mima!

01:20:41.571 --> 01:20:44.518
How dare you trick me!
For what you've done,

01:20:44.598 --> 01:20:46.260
you're going to pay!

01:21:03.350 --> 01:21:05.027
Yes, Zoroark!

01:21:09.380 --> 01:21:10.932
You ok?
-We're here!

01:21:11.122 --> 01:21:12.876
Dawn and Brock!

01:21:16.191 --> 01:21:19.465
Thanks, Bronzor!
Pikachu, Thunderbolt, let's go!

01:21:22.598 --> 01:21:24.281
Pikachu, Volt Tackle!

01:21:29.607 --> 01:21:30.934
All right!

01:21:50.426 --> 01:21:51.543
The Time Ripple...

01:21:51.997 --> 01:21:54.222
The Time Ripple
will be mine!

01:22:11.846 --> 01:22:15.778
Entei, Raikou, Suicune!
-Guardian protectors of the city!

01:22:15.909 --> 01:22:17.071
Awesome!

01:22:19.783 --> 01:22:21.244
Mima!

01:22:21.939 --> 01:22:24.049
Zoroark!
-Mima!

01:23:07.629 --> 01:23:10.534
Mima?
Mima?

01:23:12.428 --> 01:23:14.934
Wake up!
Mima!

01:23:23.747 --> 01:23:26.163
Please, Zoroark,
hang in there!

01:23:27.658 --> 01:23:30.783
You have to.
You finally found Zorua!

01:23:32.803 --> 01:23:36.212
Mima!
I promise, I'll get stronger.

01:23:36.556 --> 01:23:39.097
I'll get strong,
like you, Mima.

01:23:49.172 --> 01:23:50.452
What's going on?

01:23:51.453 --> 01:23:53.577
This is Zorua's illusion!

01:23:54.153 --> 01:23:56.923
You're right.
This is Zorua's home.

01:23:57.207 --> 01:23:58.478
Zorua's home?

01:23:59.774 --> 01:24:03.101
Mima!
Mima, let's go home together.

01:24:03.647 --> 01:24:06.160
Mima!

01:24:32.847 --> 01:24:34.900
Go on, Celebi!

01:25:42.742 --> 01:25:43.840
Mima!

01:25:54.902 --> 01:25:57.219
I knew you were stong, Mima.

01:25:57.909 --> 01:25:59.448
I knew it!

01:26:04.394 --> 01:26:06.249
I'm so happy for Zorua.

01:26:07.411 --> 01:26:10.418
It's all thanks to you.
-You were great, too.

01:26:13.498 --> 01:26:16.086
I'm so glad, you're
feeling better, Celebi.

01:26:46.168 --> 01:26:48.856
Celebi, thanks for everything!

01:26:56.310 --> 01:26:59.116
Celebi is about to Time Travel.

01:27:03.264 --> 01:27:07.556
I'll be your friend forever.
-Yeah, so will we.

01:27:07.640 --> 01:27:08.739
Yeah.

01:27:39.058 --> 01:27:41.979
<i>Stop Kodai, all the
trees and flower will die!</i>

01:27:43.038 --> 01:27:46.926
<i>What do I care!
So long, as my visionary powers grow,</i>

01:27:47.111 --> 01:27:49.994
<i>it's all worth it!
-So, you don't care</i>

01:27:50.167 --> 01:27:54.208
<i>what happens to Crown City?
-It's true, that twenty years ago,</i>

01:27:54.389 --> 01:27:58.291
<i>when I touched the Time Ripple,
Crown City withered,</i>

01:27:58.887 --> 01:28:01.520
<i>But, no one knows
a thing about that.</i>

01:28:01.788 --> 01:28:04.773
<i>Just as no one will know,
what I've done today.</i>

01:28:05.581 --> 01:28:06.919
Such a terrible man!

01:28:07.062 --> 01:28:09.581
<i>All anyone knows is
I'm doing my level best</i>

01:28:09.732 --> 01:28:12.744
<i>to capture the evil
Pokemon, Zoroark.</i>

01:28:15.995 --> 01:28:19.681
You can tell me all about it,
back at the precinct!

01:28:37.393 --> 01:28:39.080
Have a great trip!

01:28:40.655 --> 01:28:44.035
You take good care!
-Come back again, anytime!

01:28:44.152 --> 01:28:46.083
Don't be strangers!

01:28:56.445 --> 01:28:58.770
Hey, Zorua!
Will you please,

01:28:58.861 --> 01:29:01.173
stop lookin'
like me, already?!

01:29:18.986 --> 01:29:20.269
Zorua!

01:29:26.921 --> 01:29:28.756
We promise, will
come and visit you

01:29:28.901 --> 01:29:31.190
in your region next,
Zorua!

01:29:32.357 --> 01:29:33.379
Ash...

01:29:33.563 --> 01:29:35.952
Count on it!
We can't wait!

01:30:08.491 --> 01:30:11.419
What would you two do,
if you could peer into the future?

01:30:11.697 --> 01:30:14.152
I'd be bored out
of my creative mind.

01:30:14.339 --> 01:30:16.496
Why, pretell?
-Not knowing, what will happen

01:30:16.647 --> 01:30:19.076
is the spice of life.
The uncertainty of the future

01:30:19.218 --> 01:30:20.789
makes the here and now
a party.

01:30:20.978 --> 01:30:22.971
Hey, stop simplifying my schtick.

01:30:27.095 --> 01:30:30.371
Lovely breeze.
-A day of ease.

01:30:30.554 --> 01:30:34.243
Life's but a dream.
-Float down stream.

01:30:34.429 --> 01:30:37.677
And this time
in a boat!
